fixture walk_down_ramp45_off_door_stays_grounded
doc walk up test/ramp45_door_at_crest onto the door 1 u proud of the plateau at its crest edge (x 384), then walk back left down the 45-degree ramp. Up, the 8 u step up counts from the floor at the leading edge; down, the step down counts from the floor at the trailing edge (the ramp under the centre is 13 u below the door's end, under the trailing edge 3 u), so neither way leaves the ground (physics review 5, H1).
room test/ramp45_door_at_crest
spawn 236 384
frames 120
input
  0..59 R
  60..119 L
end
expect
  never 0..59 state=air
  never 60..119 state=air
end
